.card.border-0.bg-light
  .card-body
    %h2.h5 Goal of this page
    %p.mb-3
      Review apply-ready
      %strong Title create
      proposals — usually drafted via Suggest MAAP changes (Seat focus) when someone describes a role in everyday language.

    %h2.h5 How create proposals move
    %ol.mb-0
      %li Someone confirms a MAAP Suggestion (or Seat suggestion bundle) that includes a new Title.
      %li The draft appears here and in the MAAP Cleanup Inbox when submitted.
      %li A Title creator applies (creates the Title) or rejects. Linked Position/Seat proposals may wait on Title apply.
